// TEST: an inlined callee evaluates a capture read only through extents (aborts)
// Gap G238 (round 4 wave 8, Codex review round 3): the tuple-returning h reads
// q, whose kernel captures the failing deferred d through extents only. The
// call evaluates the capture privately, so d fails (BL8013) at h in every
// lane (the LLVM lane inlined h and evaluated nothing: r = (4, 0)).
